silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_01_forge_position_concrete_anchor_3 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 01_forge_position #3', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, In section 'The Forge Position --- What Phase 4 Constructs' the bare symbol Profile anchors to CitedVetRecordObject: The vet-record after citation key local-mittens-example-anchor-2026 is assigned and its source boundary is declared: this file is about Mittens, not Mittens itself. Same physical document; different Forge standing.." .
